{"seq":2,"slug":"scroll-anchoring","title":"滚动锚定与跳动：让视口里的内容纹丝不动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/techniques/scroll-anchoring","wordCount":1532,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"滚动锚定与跳动-让视口里的内容纹丝不动\">滚动锚定与跳动：让视口里的内容纹丝不动</h1><p>不定高虚拟列表最招人恨的病是「跳动」：你正在读第 200 项，往上滚了一点，画面却突然一窜，你在看的那行瞬间移位。根源不神秘——虚拟列表事先只知道各项的估算高度，滚动过程中不断把上方项的估算值替换成实测值，只要实测与估算有出入，上方内容的总高就变了，若不加处理，视口里的内容会被这份误差顶得上下乱窜。滚动锚定（scroll anchoring）就是消除这份可感位移的技术：选一个参照物，无论上方高度怎么被修正，都保证这个参照物在屏幕上的位置不动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跳动的因果链是：视口上方某项的实测高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{real}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与估算高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不等，产生高度增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>h</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = h_{real} - \\hat{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；这会让该项之后所有项（包括当前视口内容）的偏移整体平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>；由于 <code>scrollTop</code> 没变，视口显示的内容就相对滚动了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。锚定的解法是「修正高度的同时等量修正 scrollTop」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">scrollTop_{new} = scrollTop_{old} + \\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样偏移和滚动位置同步平移，两者的差（也就是视口实际展示的内容位置）保持不变，用户毫无察觉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[上方项测量: 实测比估算高 delta] --&gt; B[该项之后所有 offset 平移 delta]&#10;  B --&gt; C{是否补偿 scrollTop?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[视口内容窜动 delta&lt;br/&gt;用户看到跳动]&#10;  C --&gt;|是: scrollTop += delta| E[偏移与滚动同步平移]&#10;  E --&gt; F[视口内容位置不变&lt;br/&gt;无感修正]&#10;  G[浏览器原生 overflow-anchor] -.仅对真实 DOM 生效.-&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[上方项测量: 实测比估算高 delta] --&gt; B[该项之后所有 offset 平移 delta]\n  B --&gt; C{是否补偿 scrollTop?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[视口内容窜动 delta&lt;br/&gt;用户看到跳动]\n  C --&gt;|是: scrollTop += delta| E[偏移与滚动同步平移]\n  E --&gt; F[视口内容位置不变&lt;br/&gt;无感修正]\n  G[浏览器原生 overflow-anchor] -.仅对真实 DOM 生效.-&gt; D</pre><p>跳动的几种诱因与对应的锚定手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>跳动诱因</th>\n<th>发生时机</th>\n<th>锚定手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上方项估算误差被修正</td>\n<td>向上滚动、异步测量</td>\n<td>修正 scrollTop 补偿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片/字体加载后撑高</td>\n<td>内容异步就绪</td>\n<td><code>ResizeObserver</code> 触发补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶部插入新数据（聊天/日志）</td>\n<td>数据前插</td>\n<td>锚定到某个可见项索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展开/折叠某项</td>\n<td>用户交互</td>\n<td>以该项为锚点重算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"浏览器原生-overflow-anchor-帮得上多少\">浏览器原生 overflow-anchor 帮得上多少</h2><p>CSS 有一个原生的滚动锚定机制，由 <code>overflow-anchor</code> 属性控制（<code>auto</code> 开启、<code>none</code> 关闭），浏览器会自动挑一个屏幕内的 DOM 节点作锚点，当它上方的 DOM 变化引起位移时自动调整滚动位置，减少页面跳动（参见 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/overflow-anchor\">MDN: overflow-anchor</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-scroll-anchoring-1/\">W3C CSS Scroll Anchoring Module Level 1</a>）。它对普通长文档很有用，但对虚拟列表帮助有限，原因正是虚拟化的本质：上方的项根本不在 DOM 里，浏览器没有可锚定的节点，也就无从自动补偿。因此虚拟列表通常反而要显式 <code>overflow-anchor: none</code> 关掉原生锚定（避免它和库自己的补偿逻辑打架），改由库在 JS 层做上面那套 <code>scrollTop += Δ</code> 的手动锚定。换句话说，原生锚定解决的是「DOM 在但变了」，虚拟列表面对的是「DOM 压根不在」，两者场景不重叠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"手动锚定-选谁当锚点\">手动锚定：选谁当锚点</h2><p>手动锚定的关键设计是选参照物。有两种常见策略。一种是<strong>锚定到滚动位置</strong>：每次测量修正只补偿发生在当前 scrollTop 之上的那些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，视口内及以下的修正不影响当前视口，无需补偿。这是最通用的做法，适合任意方向滚动的浏览。另一种是<strong>锚定到具体项</strong>：记住当前视口顶部（或某个可见）项的索引和它相对视口的偏移，任何数据/高度变化后，重新把这一项摆回原来的屏幕位置。后者特别适合「顶部插入新消息」的聊天场景——你希望正在读的历史消息不动，而不是被新消息顶下去。TanStack Virtual 等库内置了这类锚定（见 <a href=\"../practice/virtual-libraries\">库 (TanStack Virtual)</a>），但理解原理能让你在库行为不符预期时知道该调什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与测量-回收的协同\">与测量、回收的协同</h2><p>锚定不是孤立技巧，它嵌在不定高的测量闭环里。<a href=\"../windowing/variable-height\">不定高与测量</a> 讲的「测量修正必须配对滚动补偿」，落到实现就是本篇的锚定。而 <a href=\"node-recycling\">节点回收</a> 的复用又要求这份补偿必须精确——如果一次补偿算错了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，复用的节点会摆错位，误差还会随滚动累积漂移。工程上要注意几点：补偿要在同一帧、DOM 更新的同步阶段完成，避免用户看到中间态；批量测量时要把多项的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 合并成一次 scrollTop 调整，减少抖动；以及要区分「用户主动滚动」和「程序补偿滚动」，别把补偿引起的 scroll 事件又当成用户滚动去触发新一轮窗口计算，形成反馈环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快速滚动与-甩尾-白屏\">快速滚动与「甩尾」白屏</h2><p>跳动之外，快速拖拽滚动条还会暴露另一类问题：滚动瞬移到远处时，目标区域的项从未被测量过，只能用估算值定位，落点可能偏差很大，用户松手后库测量真实高度再做一次较大的锚定补偿，表现为「先跳到大概位置、再轻微校正」。这没法完全消除（毕竟没渲染就没测量），但可以缓解：估算值越准落点越准（见 <a href=\"../windowing/variable-height\">不定高与测量</a> 的估算建议），配合足够的过扫描缓冲减少露白（见 <a href=\"overscan-buffer\">过扫描缓冲区</a>）。这也是「能定高就定高」的又一理由——定高没有估算误差，也就没有跳动和甩尾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跳动的成因是上方项估算高度被实测修正、产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，未补偿时视口内容窜动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>核心解法：修正高度的同时 <code>scrollTop += Δ</code>，让偏移与滚动同步平移、视口不动。</li>\n<li>原生 <code>overflow-anchor</code> 对虚拟列表基本无效（上方项不在 DOM），通常要关掉它改用 JS 锚定。</li>\n<li>锚点可选「相对滚动位置」（通用）或「相对具体项」（适合顶部插入的聊天场景）。</li>\n<li>锚定要与测量、回收协同：同帧补偿、合并批量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、区分用户滚动与补偿滚动防反馈环。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../windowing/variable-height\">不定高与测量</a> — 跳动的上游：测量修正为何产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"node-recycling\">节点回收与池化</a> — 复用节点对锚定精度的要求。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"overscan-buffer\">过扫描缓冲区</a> — 缓解快速滚动甩尾白屏。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-virtualization-windowing/mechanics/scroll-anchoring\">虚拟化的滚动锚定</a> — 另一实现视角的锚定处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滚动锚定与跳动：让视口里的内容纹丝不动","id":"滚动锚定与跳动-让视口里的内容纹丝不动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"浏览器原生 overflow-anchor 帮得上多少","id":"浏览器原生-overflow-anchor-帮得上多少"},{"level":2,"text":"手动锚定：选谁当锚点","id":"手动锚定-选谁当锚点"},{"level":2,"text":"与测量、回收的协同","id":"与测量-回收的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"快速滚动与「甩尾」白屏","id":"快速滚动与-甩尾-白屏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"节点回收与池化：让 DOM 节点数恒定且稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/techniques/node-recycling"},"next":{"title":"过扫描缓冲区：用一点冗余买不露白","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/techniques/overscan-buffer"}}